# WonderZoom checkpoint files that do not come from the Hugging Face Hub.
# Paths are relative to the checkpoints directory (checkpoints/ or $WZ_CKPT_DIR).
# Each entry is a metadata comment followed by a sha256sum line:
#   # size=<bytes> group=<download group> url=<source URL, or gdrive:<file id>>
#   <sha256>  <path>
# scripts/download_checkpoints.sh reads this file. To verify by hand:
#   (cd checkpoints && sha256sum -c ../third_party/checksums.sha256)
# size=110032539 group=core url=https://github.com/THU-MIG/RepViT/releases/download/v1.0/repvit_sam.pt
1fd2867cf669e6d89b1c91d0eb883d83ef4bcc590143dd2ca35e2705b21a4f2f  repvit_sam.pt
